taurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","review_id":"zMzrX5QCM9TezsA4glWQZg","date":"2020-11-21T00:48:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378994703292847,"text_excerpt":"Such a cute coffee shop. I enjoyed the almond croissant and chocolate muffin. The la vie en rose latte with the flowers..OMG! Cute and delicious. This is such s nice big space with sofa area and place to sit and work. It's right next to the contemporary arts center. They also have a catering menu with creole food."},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","review_id":"KSfTnVoZkTIEQfK8-eG97g","date":"2021-02-16T05:32:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261152148246765,"text_excerpt":"La Vie En Rose Cafe is my latest obsession. This eclectic spot can serve as a space to get some serious work done or it can be a place to have a cute coffee date or even hold a daytime photoshoot. I had the La Vie En Rose Lattee (one iced and one served hot) which contained the right amount of sweetness and caffeine to get the day started. Customer service is also above and beyond! P.S., it's also located right next to the Contemporary Arts Center!"},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","review_id":"u14II7PeLSOmc3O5HlwAJA","date":"2021-07-17T18:32:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9249210357666016,"text_excerpt":"This place is so cool. I had been meaning to go since they opened at this location. The owner happened to be there this day. She's very nice. I got the signature latte. It's very good. It's not overtly rose flavored. It's barely noticeable. The little design on top was so cute. Look at that panda! The coffee shop sits in the front of a neon sign studio. Very cool stuff to ogle while sipping your beverage."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","photo_id":"8M11eCUGAx7wQtn2UtVqqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8M11eCUGAx7wQtn2UtVqqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9135069251060486},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","photo_id":"tJdXqpzXignNk6VepnZv_Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tJdXqpzXignNk6VepnZv_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9050538539886475},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","photo_id":"twhw_L3iX4Nc06b2OPT6iw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/twhw_L3iX4Nc06b2OPT6iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8838187456130981},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","photo_id":"HqfHSbiFON3JBIwMaXJCnA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HqfHSbiFON3JBIwMaXJCnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8654710054397583},{"business_id":"JIMo4CQNZiLYa8Tak4EFiA","photo_id":"Ge1AshAHYjx4xosNM--fjQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ge1AshAHYjx4xosNM--fjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8125618696212769}]},"notebook_case":null}
